FINISH

! Save a real ANSYS 11 database when this input is executed in ANSYS 11.
SAVE,legacy_ansys11,DB

/SOLU
ANTYPE,MODAL
MODOPT,LANB,5
MXPAND,,,,YES
SOLVE
FINISH
SAVE,legacy_ansys11,DB

/POST1
*GET,F1,MODE,1,FREQ
*GET,F2,MODE,2,FREQ
*GET,F3,MODE,3,FREQ
*GET,F4,MODE,4,FREQ
*GET,F5,MODE,5,FREQ
*CFOPEN,legacy_ansys11_modal,txt
*VWRITE,F1,F2,F3,F4,F5
('Mode frequencies (Hz): ',5(E16.8,1X))
*CFCLOS
FINISH
